:: Deadwood Remy Gift []
<<effects>>
<<set $_remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
<<set $_farm_apple to $_remy?.farmConflict and $Orchard.unlocked.farm and $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.species is 'apple' and tree.harvests gt 0)>>
<<if $_remy?.act('gift')>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>>
  <<if !$_farm_apple>><<npcincr Remy love 2>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy takes the apple, turning it in <<his>> palm before polishing it on a clean handkerchief. "For me?" <<He>> asks. "Usually people bring these for the horses."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米接过苹果，在掌心转了一圈，再拿干净的手帕擦了擦。“给我的？”<<He>>问道。“一般他们都是带来喂马的。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $remySeen.includes('livestock')>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<He>> offers it back for a moment. "Would you rather have it yourself?" You shake your head. Remy lowers <<his>> hand. <span class='purple'>You remember another apple held just out of reach.</span> A pupil calls to <<him>> from the yard, and the moment passes.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<He>>把苹果朝你递回来一点。“还是你自己想吃？”你摇头，雷米便收回了手。<span class='purple'>你想起另一个被拿在手里、够不着的苹果。</span>庭院里的学员叫了<<him>>一声，打断了这个瞬间。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $_farm_apple>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You mention your own harvest. "From Alex's land?" Remy puts the apple on the sill. "I hope you kept something for yourself." <span class='purple'><<He>> leaves it beside the feed box, rather than in <<his>> pocket.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你说起自己种出的收成。“艾利克斯地里长的？”雷米把苹果放在窗台上。“希望你还给自己留了点。”<span class='purple'><<He>>把它留在饲料箱旁，没有放进口袋。</span>
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I'll save it for later," <<he>> says. A horse reaches over the stable door. Remy shifts the apple out of its reach and slips it into <<his>> pocket. "This one isn't for you." <<He>> looks back at you, smiling.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我留着晚点吃。”<<He>>说。一匹马从厩门上探过头来，雷米将苹果挪开，放进口袋。“这个可不是给你的。”<<He>>回头朝你笑了笑。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Thank you." <<He>> sets it on the office windowsill, apart from the box of feed apples. "I will keep that in mind."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “谢谢。”<<He>>把它放在办公室窗台上，与那箱喂马的苹果分开放着。“我会记住的。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict and $Orchard.unlocked.farm and $Orchard.farm.some(tree => tree?.species is 'apple' and tree.harvests gt 0)>>
    <br><br><<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You mention your own harvest. "Is that so?" Remy weighs the apple again. "Then I'd better give it a fair tasting."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你说起自己种出的收成。“是吗？”雷米又掂了掂苹果。“那我可得认真尝尝了。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if $_farm_apple>>
    <br><br><<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>><span class='purple'>The gift has not softened <<his>> attitude towards the farm.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>><span class='purple'>这个礼物没有让<<he>>对农场软化态度。</span>
    <</language>>
  <<else>><<glove 'Remy'>><</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You cannot give Remy an apple now. Fruit set aside in your orchard accounts stays with you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      现在没法把苹果交给雷米。果园账目里留给自己的水果不会被送出去。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-remy-return>>

:: Deadwood Remy Date []
<<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.act('date')>>
  <<set _remy_indoors to Weather.precipitation is 'rain' or Time.season is 'winter'>>
  <<set $outside to _remy_indoors ? 0 : 1>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>><<npcincr Remy love 3>><<pass 45>>
  <<if _remy_indoors>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy leads you into the office. Two mugs sit beside the kettle; <<he>> asks how you take your tea before making either. <<He>> moves the lesson register from the spare chair, but keeps it within reach. Outside, a horse stamps against its stall door.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米带你走进办公室。水壶旁摆着两个杯子；<<he>>先问你喝茶时加些什么，才开始准备。<<He>>把课程登记簿从空椅子上挪开，却仍放在伸手可及的位置。外面有匹马踢了踢厩门。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy walks beside you along the paddock fence. <<He>> closes each gate after you pass through, checking the latch with a tug. When a horse noses towards your sleeve, <<he>> draws its attention away with a click of <<his>> tongue. "They quickly learn which visitors bring treats."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米陪你沿牧场围栏走了一段。每过一道门，<<he>>都会在你身后关好，再拉一下门闩。马朝你的衣袖凑过来时，<<he>>咂了下舌，把它的注意力引走。“它们很快就能记住哪些客人会带吃的。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $Orchard.remy.dates is 1>>
      Remy asks why you wanted <<his>> company. <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>"Someone ought to make sure you take a break." "How considerate," <<he>> replies.<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>You admit that you wanted to know <<him>> better. "Well. Here I am."<<else>>You say you were curious about what <<he>> does between lessons. "Usually, I prepare for the next one."<</if>> <<He>> checks the yard before returning <<his>> attention to you.
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
      "You might have warned me you were coming." <<He>> pauses. "I could have cleared the afternoon." You ask if <<he>> really would have done. "Perhaps. You'll have to try asking." <<He>> looks pleased with <<himself>>.
    <<else>>
      "You keep finding reasons to come back," <<he>> says. "I'm beginning to suspect the school isn't the attraction." <<He>> lets the remark hang for a moment before turning back to you.
    <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $Orchard.remy.dates is 1>>
      雷米问你，为什么想找<<him>>单独待一会儿。<<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>“总得有人盯着你休息吧。”“真体贴。”<<He>>回答。<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>你承认自己想多了解<<him>>一些。“好吧，我就在这里。”<<else>>你说自己好奇<<he>>课间都做些什么。“一般是准备下一节课。”<</if>> <<He>>看了眼庭院，又将注意力转回你身上。
    <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
      “要过来，也该提前告诉我一声。”<<He>>停了一下。“说不定能空出整个下午。”你问<<he>>是不是真的愿意。“也许。你得先开口问问。”<<He>>似乎对这个回答很满意。
    <<else>>
      “你总能找到理由再过来。”<<He>>说。“我开始怀疑，吸引你的不是这所学校了。”<<He>>留了一点时间让你回答，才又转头看向你。
    <</if>>
  <</language>><<glove 'Remy'>>
  <<if $remySeen.includes('livestock')>>
    <br><br><<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>A key knocks against <<his>> belt as <<he>> moves. <span class='purple'>You recognise the sound before you look.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>一把钥匙随着<<his>>动作碰在腰带上。<span class='purple'>还没低头，你就认出了那个声音。</span>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<capture _remy_indoors>>
    <div id='deadwood-remy-date-talk'>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.farmConflict>>
        <<lanLink ['Ask whether this changes anything for Alex', '问这是否能改变艾利克斯的处境']>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Remy pulls <<his>> glove tight at the wrist. "Is that why you came?" You say you wanted to know. <<He>> watches you for a moment. "I've given Alex plenty of chances to see reason."
                <br><br>
                You tell <<him>> that you will keep helping at the farm. "Then you have work waiting for you." <<He>> turns towards a call from the track. <span class='purple'>The warmth of the visit has not carried over to Alex.</span>
              <<option 'CN'>>
                雷米将腕口的手套拉紧。“你是为了这个才来的？”你说，你想知道。<<He>>看了你一会儿。“我给过艾利克斯不少机会，让<<nnpc_him 'Alex'>>想明白。”
                <br><br>
                你告诉<<him>>，自己还会继续帮农场的忙。“那么，你还有活等着做。”<<He>>转向从跑道上传来的呼声。<span class='purple'>刚才的亲近没有让<<he>>对艾利克斯改变态度。</span>
            <</language>>
          <</replace>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<lanLink ['Ask about the school', '聊聊学校的生意']>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              "People see a pleasant afternoon," Remy says. "They don't see the feed bills." <<He>> begins listing expenses, then stops when <<he>> catches your expression. "I did say you could ask."
              <br><br>
              You ask whether a full school is worth all the trouble. "Of course. A few satisfied customers bring their friends." <<He>> smiles. "A few dissatisfied ones bring considerably more."
            <<option 'CN'>>
              “客人看见的是一个悠闲的下午。”雷米说。“可看不见饲料账单。”<<He>>开始列举开支，看到你的表情才停下来。“我确实说过，随你问。”
              <br><br>
              你问，办这所学校值不值得费这么多事。“当然。几个满意的客人就会带朋友来。”<<He>>笑了笑。“不满意的，带来的人还要多。”
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<lanLink ['Enjoy the quiet together', '安静地陪一会儿']>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if _remy_indoors>>
              Remy rotates <<his>> cup by the handle. The spoon ticks against its edge. For a while, the only conversation comes through the office window. <<He>> glances at the register, then leaves it closed.
            <<else>>
              A horse presses its nose between the rails. Remy scratches the bridge of its nose, then watches it wander off. Wind carries a shouted correction from the track. For once, <<he>> leaves someone else to give it.
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>"You needn't find something to say every time," <<he>> tells you. "I know why you're here."<<else>>"You make an unusually quiet visitor," <<he>> says. "I could get used to that."<</if>> A bell from the yard eventually ends the break. Remy straightens <<his>> gloves before returning to the pupils.
            <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if _remy_indoors>>
              雷米握着杯柄转了转杯子，勺子轻轻碰响杯沿。一时间，只有办公室窗外的人还在交谈。<<He>>瞥了眼登记簿，没有翻开。
            <<else>>
              一匹马将鼻子伸到围栏之间。雷米挠了挠它的鼻梁，看着它踱步离开。跑道上有人喊着纠正学员，这一次，<<he>>留给别人去管。
            <</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>“不用每次都找话说。”<<He>>告诉你。“我知道你为什么来。”<<else>>“客人很少有你这么安静的。”<<He>>说。“我倒可以慢慢习惯。”<</if>> 庭院的铃声最终结束了这段休息。雷米理好手套，准备回去指导学员。
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>
        <<lanLink ['Offer your hand', '把手递过去']>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-date-talk'>>
            <<language>>
              <<option 'EN'>>
                Remy looks down at your offered hand before taking it. <<His>> glove is warm at the palm and rough along the seams. A pupil stops <<if _remy_indoors>>in the office doorway<<else>>beside the fence<</if>>. <<He>> looks up without letting go. "A moment," <<he>> tells them. The pupil moves on, and <<he>> turns back to you.
              <<option 'CN'>>
                雷米先低头看了看你递来的手，才握住它。手套掌心温暖，缝线处却有些粗糙。一名学员在<<if _remy_indoors>>办公室门口<<else>>围栏旁<</if>>停下来。<<He>>抬起头，却没有松手。“稍等。”<<He>>对那人说。学员继续往前走，<<he>>才转回你这里。
            <</language>>
          <</replace>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
    </div>
  <</capture>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy cannot set aside that much time now. No arrangement is made.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米现在腾不出这么长的时间。你们没有约好。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-remy-return>>
